{"act":"governed","actor":{"actingAs":"self","client":"6335aa12-d8ee-444b-9549-405474b20d45","principal":{"issuer":"https://login.microsoftonline.com/f7ef9e19-20fa-47ac-91dd-47890978afe8/v2.0","kind":"user","name":"Michael Kang","oid":"2605c7a8-5120-4edb-98cc-76d563601c0f","tenant":"f7ef9e19-20fa-47ac-91dd-47890978afe8","username":"mike@avlon.ca"},"via":"bearer"},"at":"2026-11-05T05:39:32.439Z","attestation":{"alg":"ES256","kid":"decisions-dev-2026-11-04","sig":"lHldl9Cc1wRAV6bS6WfPleIov7RnXKYOoeF4H1tGtF6tSUm9iHeDCqewQmC6LxVRvy88u1ZnKd1nptHvi51Q1Q"},"authorization":{"delegatedBy":null,"genesis":true,"grant":"owner","rules":[]},"body":{"policy":{"grants":[{"actingAs":"self","actions":["govern","propose","revise","amend","accept","reject","revoke","supersede","check","evidence"],"id":"owner","principal":"owner","subjects":["*"]},{"actingAs":"agent:claude-code","actions":["propose","amend","check","evidence"],"delegatedBy":"owner","expires":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z","id":"agent-architect","note":"An AI agent may propose, amend, check and report evidence anywhere in HashRelay, through a Host delegation the owner mints. It may never accept, reject, revoke or supersede.","principal":"owner","subjects":["::HashRelay"]}],"note":"Who may decide what about HashRelay, ENFORCED BY THE HOST (Vision V3 Stage 9; ADR-0010 in continuum-architecture). This document travels once, as the body of the space's genesis act; after that the policy IS the record's `governed` lines, and changing it is itself a `govern` act. A principal is an issuer + oid the Host verifies from a token. A workload grant (actingAs agent:…) is usable only through a delegation token the Host issues to that workload, and never exceeds the grant it is delegatedBy.","principals":{"owner":{"issuer":"https://login.microsoftonline.com/f7ef9e19-20fa-47ac-91dd-47890978afe8/v2.0","note":"the HashRelay owner (Entra ID)","oid":"2605c7a8-5120-4edb-98cc-76d563601c0f"}},"profile":"continuum-decision-authority/1","rules":[{"actions":["accept","revoke","supersede"],"approverKinds":["human"],"id":"a-person-who-did-not-author-it-approves","note":"A HashRelay decision is approved by a person, never by whoever proposed or amended it.","separation":"distinct-party","subjects":["::HashRelay"]}]},"reason":"Stage 9: HashRelay's architectural decisions are governed from the Host-kept record"},"decision":null,"previous":null,"profile":"continuum-decision-record/1","request":"c76f11f2-946e-480f-a05e-bf3831756f75","seq":1,"space":null}
{"act":"proposed","actor":{"actingAs":"agent:claude-code","client":null,"principal":{"issuer":"https://login.microsoftonline.com/f7ef9e19-20fa-47ac-91dd-47890978afe8/v2.0","kind":"user","name":"Michael Kang","oid":"2605c7a8-5120-4edb-98cc-76d563601c0f","tenant":"f7ef9e19-20fa-47ac-91dd-47890978afe8"},"via":"delegation","workload":{"delegation":"701cafdf-e357-423f-bf4b-d527b1c6ab0e","expiresAt":"2026-11-05T13:42:17.000Z","grant":{"actions":["propose","amend","check","evidence"],"subjects":["::HashRelay"]},"id":"agent:claude-code","issuedAt":"2026-11-05T05:42:17.000Z","space":"sha256:e95ec7a36a31218578c0047e52ae08ee4c43e28549e6ef58287a61573b9f76c0"}},"at":"2026-11-05T05:43:37.810Z","attestation":{"alg":"ES256","kid":"decisions-dev-2026-11-04","sig":"ZFnkjav4MmNpGG-DOzmTotV58WLOvDD-rnwYPzuVRFGOepYbpIiLbJIM5aQGBZnobR5Ug-6K2PeiMXQKgq9opg"},"authorization":{"delegatedBy":"owner","grant":"agent-architect","policy":"sha256:9792b32aab7d1fa86b22854f484aaeefe50d78d7187a754a7a9fd2549ca88a08","rules":[]},"body":{"alternatives":["Retain until acknowledged, with no bound (what the model says today): storage grows without limit for endpoints that never return","A per-workspace replay window: more configuration than any current workspace needs"],"assumptions":[],"binding":{"kind":"model-state","note":"Stage 1 binds an acceptance to the whole model state; the scope above is recorded so a later binding can be narrower without changing this decision's identity"},"consequences":["Queued deliveries expire on a schedule, not only when the endpoint reconnects","Activity, duplicate and notification views stop counting expired deliveries as delivered"],"decision":"A delivery queued for an offline endpoint is retained until it is acknowledged or until its replay window (ReplayWindowHours, 24 by default) elapses, whichever comes first. An expired delivery is recorded as expired and is never counted as delivered.","expectations":["exists ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention","::HashRelay.Notifications.Delivery.DeliveryService satisfies ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention"],"options":[{"change":{"digest":"sha256:02b96b16f92058b0de6515f9027d2fe76797c9ff0c26230a609e6f6f12d8da71","path":"../changes/2026-11-04-bounded-offline-retention.adl-change"},"consequences":{"base":"sha256:c2824b8808af7698b9fffaf5810d7b4083593ad3f79d5778c98853a360feb405","changes":["adds Requirement ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention","modifies ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.CatchUpWithoutInterruption description","links ::HashRelay.Notifications.Delivery.DeliveryService satisfies ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention"],"method":"Host model.apply of the option's change to the decision's model","state":"sha256:a89061e4c049377dbe06faf4e79fe9fd6fd97fff1e3d2281a50cc26bddc13f7f","status":"applied"},"expectations":["exists ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention","::HashRelay.Notifications.Delivery.DeliveryService satisfies ::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery.BoundedOfflineRetention"],"name":"bounded-replay-window","summary":"A delivery held for an offline endpoint is kept for a bounded replay window, after which it expires whether or not the endpoint returns; an expired delivery is reported as expired and never as delivered."}],"rationale":"The model says queued deliveries are 'retained until acknowledged', but the code expires them after ReplayWindowHours, and only when the endpoint reconnects (RoutingService.ReplayAsync). Expired deliveries are then counted as delivered in RecentAsync, DuplicateAsync, the notification page and the dashboard. docs/ARCHITECTURE.md lists offline retention as unresolved. Unbounded retention has no upper limit on storage for a device that never returns, so the bound is made explicit and the reporting is made honest.","risks":["A device offline for longer than the window loses those notifications; it is told they expired, not that they were delivered"],"scope":[{"id":"88888888-8888-4888-8888-888888888888","kind":"Capability","ref":"::HashRelay.Notifications.HashtagDelivery","resolution":"resolved"}],"title":"Offline deliveries are kept for a bounded replay window"},"decision":"ADR-001","model":{"attestation":"sha256:9ac1f596dd6c163a1f8878a0a78cc7812aed7fe1cd6abee30ebb7e9bcb95a3c4","changeState":"sha256:c2824b8808af7698b9fffaf5810d7b4083593ad3f79d5778c98853a360feb405","compiled":"passed","contentDigest":"sha256:5953cf0e79adde7bd233bb6a8446e5c06e1b0ade48a6719746444f3c78c8a9b7","core":"adl/1.4","manifest":"../model/hash-relay.adl-manifest.json","package":"Avlon.HashRelay","reportedBy":"client","version":"draft-1"},"previous":"sha256:e95ec7a36a31218578c0047e52ae08ee4c43e28549e6ef58287a61573b9f76c0","profile":"continuum-decision-record/1","request":"12854865-cfca-46ff-be80-4b6205d0c97b","seq":2,"space":"sha256:e95ec7a36a31218578c0047e52ae08ee4c43e28549e6ef58287a61573b9f76c0"}
